			"Date": "2026-05-19T21:41:52Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1143,
				77
			],
			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Rebuild Target artifacts and register 10 new Mountain RPC methods\n\nRebuild all ESBuild output bundles in `Target/` after the preceding Mountain gRPC method additions, synchronizing the compiled JS with the refreshed route manifest.\n\nUpdate `Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts` generation timestamp from `2026-05-19T04:25:35Z` to `2026-05-19T21:31:01Z`. Ten new Mountain RPC methods are now tracked: `$terminal:hide`, `$terminal:show`, `Terminal.Hide`, `Terminal.Show` for terminal visibility toggling; `register_document_drop_edit_provider`, `register_document_paste_edit_provider`, `register_inline_completion_item_provider`, `register_inline_edit_provider`, `register_mapped_edits_provider`, `register_multi_document_highlight_provider` for additional language provider registrations. The `MountainMethods` count rises from 120 to 130.\n\nPolish comment punctuation in `Source/Debug/Server.ts` for consistency. The 40 compiled target files (JS bundles + source maps across all Cocoon layers) are regenerated to incorporate the new route set.\n\nThis keeps the build pipeline and RouteManifest aligned with the latest Mountain IPC surface.",
